{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263dhJMmKca11793615712.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山般咸道47號分行高級資深分區營業經理盧宏基表示，分行新近促成西營盤西邊街15號租賃成交，單位為中層E室，實用面積344平方呎，採1房間隔，向東，望城市景。單位放盤不足一周，迅速以2.35萬元租出，折合實用呎租68.3元。</p><p> </p><p>盧宏基表示，新租客為上班族，心儀上址鄰近港鐵站及公司，單位間隔實用且樓齡新淨，遂決定承租。據了解，業主於2021年以925萬元購入單位，持貨5年，是次出租可享約3厘租金回報。</p><p> </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:51.215726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:59:47.976935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:15.787962+00:00","content_hash":"ee914813ec16adfa4208cd6a8674c87d71d0871996d8a1381a4b2699d5300c7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:51.215726+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}